---
globs: frontend/src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Maintain a single-screen three-minute demo flow.
- Primary actions must remain: Run compromised agent, Generate guardrail, Approve and replay.
- Prioritize state clarity over settings or navigation.
- Every claim displayed in the incident explanation must be backed by event IDs from the API.
- Show loading and error states; disable actions when prerequisites are missing.
- Keep the before/after result visible without scrolling on a typical laptop screen.
- Do not expose raw secret payloads.
